1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,740
Dopamine isn't really the happy chemical. It's the wanting chemical.

2
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:09,832
It spikes when you expect a reward, and pushes you to go get it.

3
00:00:10,982 --> 00:00:17,217
That's why apps feel so addictive. You never know when the next good post will show up, so you keep scrolling.

4
00:00:18,367 --> 00:00:23,723
And lots of quick hits can make slow rewards, like studying or working out, feel boring.

5
00:00:24,873 --> 00:00:29,609
So flip it. Do the hard thing first, then use the fun thing as your reward.

6
00:00:30,959 --> 00:00:34,128
What gives you your biggest quick hit? Tell me in the comments.

7
00:00:35,778 --> 00:00:38,671
Follow me for more delayed gratification tips.

